    "id": "765c2d38-801b-4a32-918a-075428797abc",
    "title": "Draft Email:",
    "content": "File: Draft Email for CO CLDE.docx\nTitle: Draft Email:\n\nContent: Draft Email:\n\nSubject: Required to earn CLDE PD – Here’s an easy way to do it\n\nDear educator,\n\nThe Colorado State Board of Education requires all educators with Elementary, Math, Science, Social Studies, and English Language Arts (and any middle-level) endorsements to complete 45 clock hours of Culturally and Linguistically Diverse Education training or professional development. CARE Coaching from WCEPS is an approved provider for English learner professional development in Colorado.\n\n[Add some marketing content describing what CARE Coaching is/provides and a way to learn more/call to action]",
    "document_type": "docx",
