  {
    "id": "ff8e487d-1877-4fa8-84fb-7f33320d2833",
    "title": "Potential Florida Marketing Content",
    "content": "File: Potential Florida Marketing Content.docx\nTitle: Potential Florida Marketing Content\nTags: Florida detail on how to market to them. Important.\n\nContent: Potential Florida Marketing Content\n\nHere are several draft emails to use all based on the concept of tailoring EL PD (Start with CCNA) to meet the various potential needs in LEAs. IF we can create something designed to provide 60 hours of PD that covers everything in the ESOL endorsement standards, we could draft an email specific to that.\n\nComprehensive Support Grant (CSG) Funding\n\nExample email subject line: Check out CARE Coaching to meet your CSI, TSI, or ATSI required ESOL Professional Learning\n\n[Dear Educator]\n\nIs your professional learning for the ESOL section of your Comprehensive Support Grant (CSG) application in need of improvement? Check out how CARE Coaching provides high quality ESOL professional learning tailored to the needs of the educators in your school. Start with a CARE Coaching Needs Assessment (CCNA) to:\n\nIdentify strengths,\n\nPinpoint growth areas, and\n\nDrive data-informed professional learning plans to ignite sustainable instructional growth with measurable results\n\n[include a call to action, maybe something like – Check out what CARE Coaching has to offer – with a link to more information about the services CARE Coaching provides]\n\nAmend your CSG application to add CARE Coaching to meet the professional learning requirements for your school. Need help with adding CARE Coaching to your CSG application? Let us know!\n\n[then the ‘contact Yvonne’ call to action. This content can be adapted for flyers and brochures and targeted toward FL educators]\n\nEducator Certification Renewal\n\nExample email subject line: Looking for ESOL related Professional Learning? Check out CARE Coaching from WCEPS\n\n[Dear Educator]\n\nLooking for ESOL professional learning for educator certification renewal? Explore the ESOL professional learning provided by WCEPS’ CARE Coaching. CARE Coaching can help provide the in-service points your teachers need to meet educator certification renewal requirements. Start with a CARE Coaching Needs Assessment (CCNA) to:\n\nIdentify strengths,\n\nPinpoint growth areas, and\n\nDrive data-informed professional learning plans to ignite sustainable instructional growth with measurable results\n\n[include a call to action, maybe something like – Check out what CARE Coaching has to offer – with a link to more information about the services CARE Coaching provides]\n\n[then the ‘contact Yvonne’ call to action. This content can be adapted for flyers and brochures and targeted toward FL educators]\n\nFL Consent Decree in-service training requirements\n\nExample email subject line: Looking for ESOL Professional Learning to meet Consent Decree requirements? Check out CARE Coaching\n\n[Dear Educator]\n\nFlorida’s Consent Decree requires school districts to develop and implement in-service programs for educators working with English learner students. CARE Coaching can help meet those requirements. Start with a CARE Coaching Needs Assessment (CCNA) to:\n\nIdentify strengths,\n\nPinpoint growth areas, and\n\nDrive data-informed professional learning plans to ignite sustainable instructional growth with measurable results\n\n[include a call to action, maybe something like – Check out what CARE Coaching has to offer – with a link to more information about the services CARE Coaching provides]\n\n[then the ‘contact Yvonne’ call to action. This content can be adapted for flyers and brochures and targeted toward FL educators]",
