    "content": "File: chunk_30.mp4\nTitle: chunk_30\n\nContent: Thank you, thank you. I'm going to go back quickly and show that QR code. Thank you so much, Sandra. And I'm also sharing in the chat, if you are just leaving the session, if you don't mind just filling out a really brief survey, if you have a chance, those of you here, but thank you so much. This was a very informational and relevant session. Good, I'm glad. I enjoyed it. I could talk about language and culture all night. There's the QR code for the person or the individuals who asked for it. So just in case they still need it. And thank you, thank you. Thank you so much and bye. I'm listening from the call, the call. Oh, well, thank you. Thank you to those of you who've joined before school, after school, during, you know, picking up the kids from one place, taking them to the other. I appreciate it. Thank you so very much. Thank you so much. Yes. Thank you so much. I'm from Massachusetts. Thank you so much. Thank you. Thank you. Yes, thank you from Missouri. It was great. Some of the things I've already used. Please email the recordings and our point if you can. Yeah, I'll have to check. Well, I don't think we share the recordings, but we'll share as much as we can. Yeah, we do. Thank you. Thank you very much from Reno, Nevada. Thank you very much from Massachusetts. All right. Thank you. Thank you very much. Oh, it was a pleasure being with all of you. I'm gonna stop sharing so we can just say good night and go on with the rest of our evenings. And those of you joined from another country, thank you.\n",
