    "id": "a8c5a13a-600c-4849-8d15-820fb9695829",
    "title": "Draft April 7, 2016",
    "content": "Title: Draft April 7, 2016\n\nContent: Draft April 7, 2016\n\nWebbAlign DOK Professional Development Schedule for Systemic Implementation of DOK in Aldine Independent School District, Houston, TX\n\nWHO\n\nWHAT\n\nWHEN\n\nSTEP 1: Program Directors\n\nFull-day DOK introduction for all program directors.\n\n(COMPLETED on April 1, 2016)\n\nSTEP 2A: Program Directors\n\nFull-day follow-up session for any Program Directors who attended the April 1, 2016 PD session but who would like additional support with DOK. Session details TBD, depending on attendees’ needs/interests.\n\nDate: TBD\n\nSTEP 2B: Principals and Assistant Principals\n\nFull-day DOK introduction for all principals and assistant principals. Session will include examples from all content areas. Other stakeholders may be included in this group if desired. Maximum group size: 60.\n\nDate: TBD\n\nSTEP 3: Grade 9-12 Teachers\n\nFull-day DOK introduction for high school teachers from each of the following areas: mathematics, science, ELA, social studies, all other. Maximum group size: 60.\n\nDate (mathematics): TBD\n\nDate (science): TBD\n\nDate (ELA): TBD\n\nDate (social studies): TBD\n\nDate (all other): TBD\n\nSTEP 4: Grade 6-8 Teachers\n\nFull-day DOK introduction for middle school teachers from each of the following areas: mathematics, science, ELA, social studies, all other. Maximum group size: 60.\n\nDate (mathematics): TBD\n\nDate (science): TBD\n\nDate (ELA): TBD\n\nDate (social studies): TBD\n\nDate (all other): TBD\n\nSTEP 5: Grade K-5 Teachers\n\nHalf-day DOK introduction for elementary school teachers from all of the following areas: mathematics, science, ELA, social studies, and all other. Session will include examples from all content areas. Elementary school teachers will meet for a half-day (morning/afternoon) for WebbAlign DOK PD and for a half-day (morning/afternoon) with their Skills Specialist. WebbAlign sessions will run two per day.\n\nNumber of sessions: TBD\n\nAll dates: TBD",
