    "id": "623a7cb5-79bd-41c9-9a79-32f52477c7ea",
    "title": "Administering WIDA MODEL Online: Grades 1–12 (Part 7/7)",
    "content": "Accountability WIDA MODEL Online is  not  designed to satisfy the U.S. federal requirements for annual assessment and accountability.  WIDA MODEL should  not  be the  only  tool used for exiting students from ELL services.  WIDA Consortium / MetriTech",
