    "content": "Well done and appreciated.\n\nProvide location address in advance before the event.\n\nThank you. Love in person better.\n\nHow to develop common assessments with this rubric strategy\n\nHow to create a simplistic rubric but still give effective feedback.\n\nIdentifying and teaching skills that transfer from discipline to discipline.\n\ngrading with the rubric, interrater reliability, how to make sense of the rubric data\n\nReal work samples with rubrics\n\nInformation provided in advance before event day.\n\nWisconsin Center for Education Products &amp; Services\n\n1213 N. Sherman Ave., #322   Madison, WI 53704  877-272-5593   WebbAlign@wceps.org   www.webbalign.org\n\nWisconsin Center for Education Products &amp; Services\n\n1213 N. Sherman Ave., #322   Madison, WI 53704  877-272-5593   info@wceps.org   www.wceps.org",
