  {
    "id": "d520f3a6-f94c-4e17-b471-1acbcc20c256",
    "title": "A directory of the Proposal Submission Requirements is given below. (Part 4/7)",
    "content": "Initial needs assessment and goal-setting\n\nIn-person team leadership meeting\n\nFull-year CALL subscription for 9 school buildings\n\n$28,000\n\nInstructional Leadership Team (ILT) Development &amp; Principal Coaching\n\n4 in-person collaborative school leadership trainings on use of assessment data\n\n1 follow-up virtual reflection per school\n\n2 comprehensive in-person principal collaborative workshops\n\n2 site-based learning walks for 9 schools\n\n(20 total sessions)\n\n$217,500\n\nAssessment Data Analysis &amp; Use\n\ndata analyses and alignment analysis of selected interim and/or unit assessments\n\n$320,000\n\nTeacher Development &amp; Coaching\n\n6 in-person workshops x 9 schools\n\n(54 total sessions)\n\n2 virtual Learning Walk reflections per school (18 total sessions)\n\n$486,000\n\nProgress Monitoring Support\n\nDedicated support for progress monitoring and documentation of results\n\n$46,000\n\nProject Management\n\nDedicated support for project scheduling\n\n$24,000\n\nPlanning and Reflection Meetings\n\nWeekly planning meetings with the Collaborative Director and Relevant Staff\n\n$24,000\n\nDocumentation of Progress, Recommendations, and Report Writing\n\nCoordination and delivery of all documentation, reports, and recommendations\n\n$36,000\n\nTotal\n\n$1,181,500\n\nTable 3. Unit rates for add-on services\n\nService\n\nDescription\n\nCost\n\nIn-person workshop\n\nUp to 50 participants\n\n$8,500 per session\n\nVirtual Coaching\n\n1-hour virtual session\n\n$1,500 per session\n\nCALL Survey\n\n1-year subscription\n\n$2,000 per school\n\nAlignment analyses\n\nDependent on included content and scope of work\n\nTBD\n\nPlanning Meetings\n\n1-hour weekly planning and reflection meetings\n\n$500 per session\n\nSection D – Project Schedule and Implementation Plan\n\nTimeline\n\nActivity\n\nDescription\n\nMay 2025\n\nInitial needs assessment and goal-setting\n\nIn collaboration with the Collaborative Director, ILTs, and principals, WCEPS will use DPS input, assessment data, and/or results of CALL surveys to provide actionable data and insights into strengths and growth opportunities at each school.\n\nCARE Coaching Data Retreat\n\nAn in-person workshop that reviews all input and data, selects focus areas for the 2025–2026 school year and develops improvement plans.\n\nDELIVERABLE:\n\nDetailed implementation plan, including coaching schedules and PD calendars\n\nAugust 11-15\n\nProfessional Learning Workshops\n\nThe first workshop in a series of professional learning activities based on finalized implementation plans.\n\nAdministrator Coaching\n\nAn in-person coaching session with  Instructional Leadership Teams focused on progress monitoring.\n\nSept 22, 2025\n\nProfessional Learning Workshops\n\nThe second workshop in a series of professional learning activities based on finalized implementation plans.\n\nSept 23, 2025\n\nGuided Learning Walks\n\nCARE Coaching guided learning walks and reflection activities with Instructional Leadership Teams.\n\nOct 30, 2025\n\nGuided Learning Walks\n\nCARE Coaching guided learning walks and reflection activities with Instructional Leadership Teams focused on progress monitoring.\n\nOct 31, 2025\n\nProfessional Learning Workshops\n\nThe third workshop in a series of professional learning activities based on finalized implementation plans.\n\nNovember\n\nLearning Walks with Virtual Reflection\n\nSchool and district leaders will conduct learning walks focused on progress monitoring followed by a 1-hour virtual reflection with CARE Coaching.\n\nDecember 2025\n\nMid-Year Progress Monitoring\n\nFocused check-in to provide data relative to targeted professional learning and implementation.\n\nJan 5, 2026\n\nProfessional Learning Workshops\n\nThe fourth workshop in a series of professional learning activities based on finalized implementation plans.\n\nJanuary 2026\n\nLearning Walks with Virtual Reflection\n\nInstructional Leadership Teams will conduct learning walks focused on progress monitoring followed by a 1-hour virtual reflection with CARE Coaching.\n\nFebruary 2026\n\nLearning Walks with Virtual Reflection\n\nInstructional Leadership Teams will conduct learning walks followed by a 1-hour virtual reflection with CARE Coaching.\n\nFeb 27, 2026\n\nProfessional Learning Workshops\n\nThe fifth workshop in a series of professional learning activities based on finalized implementation plans.\n\nMarch 2026\n\nLearning Walks with Virtual Reflection\n\nInstructional Leadership Teams will conduct learning walks focused on progress monitoring followed by a 1-hour virtual reflection with CARE Coaching.\n\nApril 2026\n\nEnd-of-Year CALL Administration\n\nA re-administration of the CALL survey to measure growth over the year.\n\nMay 1, 2026\n\nProfessional Learning Workshops\n\nThe sixth workshop in a series of professional learning activities based on finalized implementation plans.\n\nDELIVERABLE (ONGOING August 2025-May 2026): Documentation of coaching sessions, data review and progress monitoring reports including instructional recommendations at agreed upon checkpoints.\n\nMay 2026",
