    "id": "4ae8f2a8-8371-4e57-be93-25aef74c636f",
    "title": "A directory of the Proposal Submission Requirements is given below.",
    "content": "The Wisconsin Center for Education Products and Services (WCEPS) is pleased to provide a proposal in response to Denver Public Schools’ (DPS) Request for Proposal BD 2573. Our programs provide a constellation of critical expertise of great value for advancing DPS’ goals. This includes expertise with systemic analysis of needs, content alignment analysis, appropriate interpretation of assessment data to inform productive and constructive uses, and professional learning for K-12 audiences focused on fostering coherent systems that promote rigorous learning opportunities for all students. Our programs bring decades of experience in key areas that resonate strongly with DPS’ Strategic Roadmap and Instructional Framework.\n\nA directory of the Proposal Submission Requirements is given below.\n\n1. Organization Overview – Provided in Section E: Supplier Profile\n\n2. Approach &amp; Methodology – Provided in Section B: Management Summary\n\n3. Staffing Plan – Provided in Section E: Supplier Profile\n\n...",
