    "content": "Proposal: WebbAlign DOK Professional Learning for\n\nFayette County Public Schools Career &amp; Technical Education Teachers - School Year 2021-2022\n\nFayette County Public Schools Contact: Lisa Collins, Director of Career &amp; Technical Education (collins.lisa@mail.fcboe.org; 770-500-0445)\n\nWebbAlign Contact: Sara Christopherson, Director of WebbAlign (sara.christopherson@wceps.org; 608-698-1966)\n\nProposal below. Adjustments, additions, clarifications, etc. are welcome for all steps.\n\nParticipants\n\nSchedule\n\nGoals and Proposed Plan\n\nLisa, all CTE educators (~70)\n\nJuly 27, 2021\n\nGoals: Collect pre-session perspectives on topics related to complexity and DOK. Use pre-reading materials and discussion prompts to start small group conversations about DOK.\n\nPlan: Provide materials via online webspace. Teachers will access materials on their own devices, read, respond individually to questions, and then discuss responses during their July planning meeting. Sara will provide Lisa with recorded ...",
