  {
    "id": "af23eb7f-cbcc-4e32-a88d-4e70e136302d",
    "title": "CHECKLIST FOR REVIEWING DRAFTED ITEMS:",
    "content": "Title: CHECKLIST FOR REVIEWING DRAFTED ITEMS:\n\nContent: CHECKLIST FOR REVIEWING DRAFTED ITEMS:\n\nNeeds Revisions\n\nMeets Expectations\n\nCheck for content relevance and DOK\n\nDoes the item target particular knowledge, skills, or abilities that is/are essential to the intent of the standard and element?\n\nDoes the overall item (inclusive of distractors) present a question/task at the intended DOK level?\n\nComments:\n\nCheck item structure and components\n\nIf a stimulus is used, is the content necessary for students to answer the question, accessible, and clearly presented?\n\nAre all distractors plausible and reasonable with only one correct answer choice?\n\nDo distractors have parallel structure and are they listed in an appropriate order?\n\nComments:\n\nCheck for excess difficulty\n\nAre there any vocabulary terms that could be simplified?\n\nAre there formulas or other resources that could be provided?\n\nAre directions needed? And if so, are the directions clear?\n\nComments:\n\nCheck language\n\nIs the question or task focused, clear, and understandable?\n\nDoes the item use plain language that is written in an appropriate and respectful tone?\n\nDoes each answer choice fit grammatically with the question?\n\nComments:\n\nCheck for bias and sensitivity\n\nDoes any part of the item include language that could be offensive or negative toward a particular religion, disability, ethnicity, etc?\n\nDoes the item favor students with or rely on knowledge of particular life backgrounds and experiences?\n\nDoes the item context require specialized knowledge outside of the content being assessed (e.g. surfing, horseback riding, motorcycle parts, etc.)\n\nComments:\n\nCheck appropriateness for audience\n\nAre examples and contexts appropriate for the student audience?\n\nDoes the item respect, value and affirm the diversity of the student population?\n\nComments:\n\nInclude any additional comments or feedback here:\n\nWisconsin Center for Education Products &amp; Services\n\n1213 N. Sherman Ave., #322   Madison, WI 53704  877-272-5593   info@wceps.org   www.wceps.org\n\nWisconsin Center for Education Products &amp; Services\n\n1213 N. Sherman Ave., #322   Madison, WI 53704  877-272-5593   WebbAlign@wceps.org   www.webbalign.org",
