use....  I wonder…  I can conclude that…  I see....  I think that if we do.....this will happen....  I have seen something like this before....  Video: http://stem4els.wceruw.org  STUDENT DISCOURSE MOVES  3 D Question or challenge Tell and explain Clarify someone's idea Ł cD 3 Ł e WORKING WITH IDEAS: Ł Build on g an idea $ 3 g Ł Ł e Ł D Support an idea Student Discourse Moves Compare ideas Restate or summarize iiismaterial is based upon work supported by the National Sdencefoundatioo under Grant No. DRl-1346491. Any ŁŁŁ CEZ2ECSE5EC3EE210**--*.eons.waooana  DOING AND TALKING MATH AND SCIENCE Strengthening Reasoning, Strengthening Language  Tell or explain a new idea  \"I think...,\"  \"I know it will work because.. \"The best strategy would be..  • • we • me • • • • me •• • • • • • me • • • • • • we • • • • •••ŁŁ1  '  '  Clarify someone's idea  \"Say again, please.\"  \"What did you mean when you  1  said...?\"  \"Are you saying that...?\"  i  _________________________________ i  Restate or summarize an idea  \"He said...\"  \"In other words, ...\"  \"The suggestion was made that...\"  \" Ł Ł Ł • Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł Ł \"\"ŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁ4  Compare ideas  \"The same.\"  \"Ours is better because...\"  \"The new strategy is more efficient because..,\"  Ł -ŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁ\"ŁŁŁŁŁ\"ŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁ4  Ł Ł Ł --ŁŁ-ŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁ------ŁŁŁ-ŁŁŁŁŁi  Support an idea  \"Good idea, because...\"  \"Remember, it said in our book that.. \"  \"The advantage of that method is...\"  -----ŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁ-----Ł-ŁŁ-ŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁŁi  Build on an idea  \"Let's try that.\"  \"We should change our model to show that.\"  \"That idea would help us figure out why. ..\"  l  --------------------- Question or challenge an idea  \"Why?\"  \"But that doesn't explain what we saw when...\"  \"Is there a more efficient way to ...?\"  © 2024 CARE Coaching  Explore bubbles using student moves  Are bubbles a gas or a liquid? Explain  A bubble has TWO states of matter in it.  • Liquid  • Gas  Where is each state of matter?  ➢