  {
    "id": "cd158e50-a102-459c-b637-07cf2e048850",
    "title": "WebbAlign  Services Industry Partners",
    "content": "A WCEPS Program Industry Partners Quality – the real competitive advantageOur partner program supports your commitment to produce high quality, aligned instructional material and assessments. As a Depth of Knowledge (DOK) Partner, you’ll gain a competitive edge through an ongoing cycle of professional learning and item evaluations. Read what one of our first Partners reported about their experience.How does it work?Our certification mark symbolizes your organization’s dedication to continuously providing educators and students the highest quality instructional materials and assessments, working toward consistent and accurate application of DOK. The certification requirements initially include:One full-day professional development seminar facilitated by the WebbAlign teamOne external annual item review by the WebbAlign teamAfter committing to the cycle of continuous improvements, new partners have the right to use the WebbAlign DOK Partner Certification Badge on promotional materials for all certified products. Following completion of initial partnership requirements, we will work together to identify the types of support and evaluation that will help you as you develop and refine your materials.Take the first step towards a serious competitive advantage and contact us today. Click here to read more about using the results of alignment analyses to inform ongoing item-level improvements. Welcome, Stride, our newest DOK Partner! WebbAlign Partners Apex Learning is the leading provider of blended and virtual learning solutions to the nation's schools. Our digital curriculum provides an active learning experience that engages all students in rigorous coursework to prepare them for college and work. The standards-based digital curriculum—in math, science, English, social studies, world languages, electives, and Advanced Placement®—is widely used for original credit, credit recovery, remediation, intervention, acceleration, and exam preparation. As a company of educators, Edgenuity believes all learners can achieve their full potential, and educators work tirelessly to help their students do that. That’s why they’ve made it our mission to provide schools with the tools and resources they need to leverage technology in ways that improve student outcomes. Edmentum’s powerful learning solutions blend technology with individual teaching approaches. We are committed to making it easier for educators to individualize learning for every student through simple technology, actionable data, quality content, and a passion for customer success. Glynlyon is a world-class educational technology company that provides services to well over 1 million students annually in the institutional and consumer education markets. As the parent company of sector leaders Odysseyware and AOP, Glynlyon provides comprehensive online curriculum solutions to school districts and students in the home education market—with a nationwide footprint of over 3000 public school district partners, industry leading homeschool curriculum, and two fully accredited private virtual schools. Through innovation and superior customer service, Glynlyon strives to be the provider of choice for initial credit, credit recovery, blended learning and home-based learning. As pioneers in personalized learning, Imagine Learning is heavily invested in education research; continually refining our adaptive digital curricula. By working closely with teachers, administrators, and parents to create student-centered products, we are shaping the future of education together. Stride's mission is to help learners of all ages reach their full potential through inspired teaching and personalized learning. With insight and input from learners, parents, school districts, boards of education, and policymakers, Stride continues to provide more effective ways to learn—focusing on building the skills and confidence learners need to make their way forward—at every step in life.",
