  {
    "id": "bea1de41-55fe-4020-a6ae-8c7d041cf63e",
    "title": "Features Quick Call",
    "content": "Description: Callsurveyv2\n\nLearn More > Features > \"Quick CALL\" \"Quick CALL\" The \"C\" in CALL truly stands for \"COMPREHENSIVE.\" The full version of CALL produces a wealth of action-based data to support school improvement. However, to support continuous school improvement, the CALL system provides the \"Quick CALL\" feature. Through this feature, education leaders can create customized, abridged surveys containing only the items they select through creating a custom report. Rather than administer the full version of CALL on a regular basis, leaders utilize the Quick CALL function.The Quick CALL feature is a powerful tool to engaging in continuous school improvement in an efficient and effective way.",
    "document_type": "website",
    "file_name": "Features Quick Call.html",
