    "id": "82723efb-734a-42df-b232-ae4a79c55bc8",
    "title": "What We Do West Ed District Level",
    "content": "Description: Callsurveyv2\n\nWhat We Do > WestEd > District Level District-Level Assessment and Feedback The Four Domains CALL District-Level survey and feedback system measures key leadership practices district-wide that are aligned to the Four Domains for Rapid School Improvement framework from the Center on School Turnaround at WestEd. Rather than focus on an individual district leader, the Four Domains CALL utilizes a multi-source comprehensive survey to assess core leadership practices that are distributed across the district that impact school-level leadership. Upon completion of the survey, district leaders receive immediate targeted data and feedback designed to support district-wide school improvement planning and professional growth.Access this document for more information on the Four Domains CALL District-Level Domains, Subdomains, and sample survey items. You can view sample District-Level survey items and navigate the CALL Data Feedback Reporting System: Sample District-Level Survey Sample Feedback Report",
    "document_type": "website",
