    "id": "215a330f-d8bd-458e-a34e-c8b518053aa2",
    "title": "What We Do West Ed School Level",
    "content": "Description: Callsurveyv2\n\nWhat We Do > WestEd > School Level School-Level Assessment and Feedback The Four Domains CALL System is an online school-wide leadership assessment and feedback system. Rather than focus on an individual school leader, the system utilizes a multi-source comprehensive survey to assess core leadership practices that are distributed across the school building and that are aligned to the Four Domains for Rapid School Improvement framework from the Center on School Turnaround at WestEd. Upon completion of the Four Domains CALL survey, users receive immediate, targeted data and feedback designed to support school improvement and professional growth. Access this document for more information on the Four Domains CALL School-Level Domains, Subdomains, and sample survey items. You can also view sample School-Level survey items and navigate the CALL Data Feedback Reporting System: Sample School-Level Survey Sample Feedback Report",
