    "title": "Family Engagement Workshops | Events | WCEPS Pathways",
    "content": "Description: Join WCEPS for CARE Coaching events designed to promote family engagement in the classroom. Virtual workshops are for educators.\n\nFamily Engagement Workshops Building Community through Family Engagement Virtual Workshops Overview This workshop explores the value of building community and the components of effective family partnerships. Creating an environment that leverages families as a reliable resource for engaging students and honoring culture fosters an inclusive learning community. After this workshop, participants will be able to: Define family engagement Consider research that supports family engagement Examine cultural proficiency Identify ways to extend learning Current schedule 2026 Coming soon VIRTUAL WORKSHOPS Coming soon COST $400 REGISTRATION Coming Soon Events Interested in professional development opportunities for educators? Explore our events or contact us to set up a workshop designed for your team! Find an event Learning Library The WCEPS Pathways Learning Library provides free access to articles, videos and downloadable PDFs to support student learning in your classroom. Learn More CARE Coaching CARE Coaching is designed to help K-12 educators provide equitable educational opportunities for long-term learners through personalized coaching. Learn More Learning Library The WCEPS Pathways Learning Library provides free access to articles, videos and downloadable PDFs to support student learning in your classroom. Read More Contact Us CARE Coaching provides customized learning opportunities designed for administrators, teachers, school and district leaders. Ready to learn more? ×",
