    "id": "8b4f5447-9507-4a74-a281-bc6e4a9a9286",
    "title": "Unit Planning for Educators | Events | WCEPS Pathways",
    "content": "Description: Join WCEPS for CARE Coaching events designed to improve unit planning centered around ELD standards framework. Workshops are for educators.\n\nUnit Planning Workshops Blueprints for Brilliance: Designing Units with the ELD Standards Framework Virtual Workshops Overview Participants will explore the integrated components of the 2020 WIDA ELD Standards Framework and apply them by designing content-aligned unit sketches. Participants will identify effective strategies for embedding language functions and features into grade-level instruction and create discourse-based anchor charts to support multilingual learners’ expressive language development across content areas. After this workshop, participants will be able to: Examine the interconnectedness of the 2020 WIDA Standards Framework components. Design a unit sketch to map ELD standards framework components to content-area instruction Explore ways to implement instruction of language functions and features within grade-level content lessons. Create a discourse anchor chart for a content-area expressive language task Current schedule 2026 March 24, 2026 (virtual)11:00- 2:00 pm CT VIRTUAL WORKSHOPS March 24, 2026, 11:00am-2:00pm US Central Time COST $400 REGISTRATION Register Now Events Interested in professional development opportunities for educators? Explore our events or contact us to set up a workshop designed for your team! Find an event Learning Library The WCEPS Pathways Learning Library provides free access to articles, videos and downloadable PDFs to support student learning in your classroom. Learn More CARE Coaching CARE Coaching is designed to help K-12 educators provide equitable educational opportunities for long-term learners through personalized coaching. Learn More Looking to learn more about CARE Coaching? Reach out to one of our experts to guide you on a pathway to success! Contact Us Contact Us CARE Coaching provides customized learning opportunities designed for administrators, teachers, school and district leaders. Ready to learn more? ×",
