    "title": "Pathways Service Offerings",
    "content": "Description: Explore our Pathways products and services including research-based  professional learning, coaching, resources and more.\n\nProducts and Services Chart Your Learning Course Discover our Pathways programs and see how they can support you and your school in achieving your goals! SERVICE OVERVIEW WHO WE HELP AREA OF NEED SERVICE OVERVIEW Collaborative Educator Support Reflective and Data-Driven Practices Student-Centered Growth WHO WE HELP Districts Schools School-based Educators Higher Education AREA OF NEED Builds collaborative relationships, eliciting strengths and knowledge from all participants to provide growth opportunities for school leaders, teachers, and students. Explore SERVICE OVERVIEW Integrated Instruction Student Achievement WHO WE HELP Administrators Educators Leaders AREA OF NEED Provides professional development and capacity building for educators using the Framework for Authentic Intellectual Work. This framework focuses on high-quality learning experiences based on three criteria. Explore SERVICE OVERVIEW Leadership tools Leadership development School improvement Tailored support WHO WE HELP Administrators Districts Education Leaders Schools AREA OF NEED The Comprehensive Assessment of Leadership for Learning (CALL) provides unique tools and customized services to support professional growth, leadership development, and school improvement planning. Explore SERVICE OVERVIEW Practical tools Discussion plan Immediate application Collaborative learning WHO WE HELP Education Leaders Teachers Higher Education AREA OF NEED Provides professional learning courses to help design, implement and facilitate inclusive and intellectually rigorous discussion classrooms. Explore SERVICE OVERVIEW DOK program Cognitive engagement Complexity levels Assessment tasks WHO WE HELP Education Leaders Teachers Content Developers AREA OF NEED Utilizes the Depth of Knowledge (DOK) program, which helps determine the degree of complexity of cognitive engagement is being translated into appropriate learning opportunities and assessment tasks. Explore SERVICE OVERVIEW Special Populations Student Achievement WHO WE HELP Education Leaders Districts Schools Teachers AREA OF NEED WCEPS oﬀers and delivers a variety of WIDA-developed professional learning opportunities to support educators of multilingual learners. Whether you are a language specialist, content teacher with multilingual learners in your classroom, or a high school principal, these workshops can meet your needs. Explore Pathways Programs & Services CARE Coaching CARE Coaching partners with educators, providing tailored professional development through workshops, program evaluations, and personalized coaching sessions to enhance teaching practices and support learner success. AIW Institute The AIW Institute offers professional development and capacity building using the Framework for Authentic Intellectual Work, developed by Drs. Fred Newmann, M. Bruce King, and colleagues at the University of Wisconsin–Madison. CALL The Comprehensive Assessment of Leadership for Learning (CALL) provides unique tools and customized services to support professional growth, leadership development, and school improvement planning. It focuses on leadership for learning. The Discussion Project The Discussion Project, designed at the University of Wisconsin-Madison, provides specialized professional learning courses to help facilitate more engaging, inclusive, and intellectually rigorous discussion classrooms. WebbAlign In collaboration with Dr. Norman Webb, the developer of Depth of Knowledge (DOK), WebbAlign promotes effective and accurate use of this innovative language system for attainment of desired learning outcomes. WIDA Licensed Offerings WIDA develops and provides proven tools and support to help learners and their educators, succeed. WCEPS is the sole source provider of materials sold on the WIDA Store website and WIDA-licensed workshops. Not sure which pathway works best for your school? Reach out to one of our experts to guide you on a pathway to success! Connect with us Some of Our Partners Contact Us CARE Coaching provides customized learning opportunities designed for administrators, teachers, school and district leaders. Ready to learn more? ×",
