  {
    "id": "81d5e04b-b903-4b52-a3b9-85481925fd9e",
    "title": "CARE COACHING INTERNATIONAL",
    "content": "Title: CARE COACHING INTERNATIONAL\n\nContent: CARE COACHING INTERNATIONAL  CARE Coaching International, offered through the Wisconsin Center for Education products and Services, is designed to ensure that international educators and leaders are supported to provide equitable educational opportunities for multilingual learners.  VIEW (<https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wfuS9wYyxF_HDYgKg85p-9i0VQ7ESj-S/view>)ALL OPTIONS  SYSTEMATIC, OUTCOMES-BASED APPROACHES  PLANNING WITH UNIVERSAL DESIGN FOR LEARNING FOR CONTENT & LANGUAGE INTEGRATION  Participants examine the principles of Universal Design for Learning as a framework for differentiating instruction in ways that engage all multilingual learners in grade-level content by providing multiple means of representation, expression, and engagement to support diverse learners.  Formats include virtual, in -person and half day sessions with afternoon co-planning time with a trained CARE Coach.  INSTRUCTIONAL IMPLICATIONS OF LANGUAGE PROFICIENCY SCORES  Our CARE Coaches can support your teachers and leaders to determine next steps and instructional implications of language proficiency data. Participants will use the rubrics to plan linguistic scaffolds and review student data with an asset-based approach.  BUILDING A COLLABORATIVE CULTURE FOR MULTILINGUAL LEARNER SUCCESS  Participants examine the key elements of a collaborative culture that fosters partnerships among educators, families, administrators, support staff to ensure the success of multilingual learners across the school community  Formats include virtual, in -person and half day sessions with afternoon co-planning time with a trained CARE Coach.  COLLABORATIVE LEARNING WALKS  We can tailor Learning Walks and Outcomes that align to your initiatives and school goals and provide actionable feedback and debrief with leaders.  Collaborative, in-person walks, or virtual followups to debrief with leaders.  CONTACT US  LEARN MORE ABOUT CARE COACHING INTERNATIONAL  (<https://www.wcepspathways.org/>)wcepspathways.org ",
