    "id": "295c27e5-7403-41ff-970b-122b6d33905e",
    "title": "WebbAlign - Technical Quality in Assessment Innovation | Learning Library | Pathways",
    "content": "Description: The WebbAlign program of WCEPS, in collaboration with Lyons Assessment Consulting, and KnowledgeWorks and EduDream, explore this in a new publication, “Evaluating Technical Quality in the Context of Assessment Innovation.”\n\nHow do we evaluate the quality of innovative assessments, especially those designed to support deeper learning and instructional relevance? The WebbAlign program of WCEPS, in collaboration with Lyons Assessment Consulting and KnowledgeWorks explore this in a new publication, “Evaluating Technical Quality in the Context of Assessment Innovation.”​ Read about our findings, based on a case study of a curriculum-embedded performance assessment. This report is part of a collection of research on innovative assessment approaches and alternative accountability models coordinated under The K12 Research for Equity Hub, managed by EduDream. Read the full report Looking to learn more about WCEPS Pathways? Reach out to one of our experts to guide you on a pathway to success! Connect with us Contact Us CARE Coaching provides customized learning opportunities designed for administrators, teachers, school and district leaders. Ready to learn more? ×",
