    "id": "37a118a8-86ce-43ab-95d8-4bcae95d74bc",
    "title": "WIDA Licensed Offerings - Pathways",
    "content": "WIDA Licensed Offerings WCEPS is the sole source provider of the following WIDA products and services for schools and districts. These products and services are developed by WIDA and delivered by WCEPS. AREAS OF NEED Language Assessment Special Populations Student Achievement Offerings WIDA-licensed products and services for schools and districts. WIDA Licensed Workshops Professional learning webinars and in-person-workshops to support educators of learners of all backgrounds Explore WIDA School Improvement System (SIS) An online school-wide needs assessment, leadership development tool, and feedback system Explore WIDA MODEL Assessments designed to measure students’ progress in English language development Explore WIDA Store A variety of products and educational materials available for purchase online to meet your school/district’s needs Explore WIDA PRIME A tool for evaluating instructional materials to ensure alignment in meeting the needs of English learners Explore Reach out to one of our experts to guide you on a pathway to success! Connect with us WIDA is housed within the Wisconsin Center for Education Research in the School of Education, University of Wisconsin-Madison. WIDA and the WIDA logo are trademarks of the Board of Regents of the University of Wisconsin System. Contact Us CARE Coaching provides customized learning opportunities designed for administrators, teachers, school and district leaders. Ready to learn more? ×",
