  {
    "id": "c009ec28-6a6b-4bc4-a3b4-daeb44b10ca6",
    "title": "CARE Coaching | Pathways",
    "content": "CARE Coaching CARE Coaching: The Three Cs – Consulting, Coaching, and Continuous Learning At CARE Coaching, we support educators by focusing on the Three Cs: Consulting, Coaching, and Continuous Learning. Our professional learning offerings are designed to help educators reflect on their current practices and implement research-based actions that lead to meaningful change. Through a holistic approach, we offer ongoing professional development and tailored programmatic support across various topics. We customize our work to meet your unique needs, offering: Professional learning to foster instructional growth and sustainable changes Coaching to ensure that measurable outcomes are achieved and sustained Scheduling designed to accommodate your educators’ availability Availability across all time zones to support teams wherever they are With the Three Cs, our approach ensures lasting impact by guiding educators through reflection, strategy development, and continuous improvement. CARE Coaching Topics Connect with us Meet our CARE Coaching Team Register for a CARE Coaching Event CARE Coaching Needs Assessment (CCNA) Turn Insight Into Instructional Impact Learn more today! Testimonials Multi-Phase Program Evaluation This exceeded my expectations and spoke to the important message of Tier 1 instruction. Area Superintendent, Suburban District Suburban District Implementation of Federal Guidelines The work your team has done this year to support our district goals in improving our ELL Programs went beyond my expectations. District Superintendent, Urban District Urban District Leadership Development Yes, Yes, Yes! This workshop was so helpful for me…I was worried that this would be another workshop that gives strategies that are not practical! This workshop was none of that, it was engaging, practical and gave me so many valuable ideas. Instructional Coach, Large Suburban District Large Suburban District Professional Learning Community Coaching Having time in PLCs to dig further into the concepts we learned added a layer of application that we have not had before, thank you! 4th Grade Team, Large Suburban School District Large Suburban School District I really appreciated talking to you about the CARE Coaching program and felt very energized by our conversation. I am so excited that your company is offering exactly what we need to support our educators. Director of English Learner Education Dual Language I am inspire to attend to language and content while keeping grade-level expectations in mind. I plan to be more creative in how I am teaching kids who are learning multiple languages. Elementary Educator, Suburban District Suburban District Train the Trainer Thank you so much! Your team is easy to work with and your flexibility is appreciated. CARE coaching makes the hard work of delivering PL less daunting. ESOL Coordinator, Rural District Rural District Success Stories We’re proud to have successful collaborations with independent schools and districts from 200 students to 17,000+ students. We currently have 53 renewed district partnerships with 12,000+ educators working towards equitable outcomes for all learners. Here are a few different ways we have collaborated with educators: Consulting Services include program evaluations and monitoring to support educators and school districts in achieving their goals and ensuring program effectiveness. DUAL ID – SPECIAL EDUCATION & MLS: Support collaboration between district Special Ed. and EL Program leaders Mid-sized suburban districtict MULTI-PHASE PROGRAM EVALUATION AND COACHING SUPPORT: Build capacity federal Govt Learnings Walk with 900 teachers at 12 K-12 Schools Debrief teacher coaching Mid-sized urban district DUAL ID – SPECIAL EDUCATION & MLS: Support collaboration between district Special Ed. and EL Program leaders Mid-sized suburban district Continuous Learning On-going assessments and improvement planning are essential for educators and school districts as part of long-term planning, growth and setting students up for success. VIRTUAL INSTRUCTION FOR MLS: Multimodal virtual workshop for virtual classrooms Charter school BILINGUAL SCHOOLS: Professional Learning for Dual Language Program Spanish-language workshop by bilingual facilitators Mid-sized urban district NEWCOMER SUPPORT LARGE INFLUX OF STUDENTS: Professional Learning geared towards newcomer support Customized learning for common country of origin and SEL needs. 2 rural districts Coaching Coaching services are designed for district leaders and educators to support professional growth and leadership development. TRAIN THE TRAINER: Train PD Specialists to deliver to their own district Large urban district 5-YEAR LEADER COACHING: Administrator Coaching for 8 admin and their leadership teams 1-1 Coaching for Admin Mid-sized urban district PRE-K MLs: Early Childhood facilitators WIDA Early Years Alignment Pre-schools of large urban district I have so appreciated the high quality of our professional development with you all! It has really taken my lesson planning to a new level! 🙂 Thank you! — Washington Educator Meet our CARE Coaching Team! Contact Us CARE Coaching provides customized learning opportunities designed for administrators, teachers, school and district leaders. Ready to learn more? ×",
