    "title": "Grade 1 Tier B/C",
    "content": "Grade 1 Tier B/C  ACCESS for ELLs®  Sample Writing Item: David’s Idea  Using this document: Review this sample item to gain a better understanding of the look, feel, and process of the ACCESS for ELLs Online Writing test. Use this item in any way that is helpful for you and your students: for example, you might assign this item as homework, as an in-class exercise, or as a group activity. If practical for your classroom, WIDA strongly encourages you to use the sample test administrator script to do a full mock administration of this sample item, as a realistic administration can help prepare your students for the real test.  If you do plan a mock administration, read through this document and set aside 30 minutes to explain the activity and allow students to write their responses. Create materials for the mock administration by printing:  •  One copy of pages 2–4 for each student.  You can print pages 3 and 4 as a double-sided single sheet.  •  One copy of pages 6–7 for yourself.  You ...",
