    "title": "Grade 1 Tier A",
    "content": "Grade 1 Tier A  ACCESS for ELLs®  Sample Writing Item: Making a Card  Using this document: Review this sample item to gain a better understanding of the look, feel, and process of the ACCESS for ELLs Online Writing test. Use this item in any way that is helpful for you and your students: for example, you might assign this item as homework, as an in-class exercise, or as a group activity. If practical for your classroom, WIDA strongly encourages you to use the sample test administrator script to do a full mock administration of this sample item, as a realistic administration can help prepare your students for the real test.  If you do plan a mock administration, read through this document and set aside 30 minutes to explain the activity and allow students to write their responses. Create materials for the mock administration by printing:  •  One copy of pages 2–5 for each student.  •  One copy of pages 7–8 for yourself.  You can print this as double-sided single sheet.  Explain to your ...",
