mpshire New Jersey New Mexico New York North Carolina North Dakota Northern Mariana Islands Ohio Oklahoma Oregon Pennsylvania Puerto Rico Rhode Island South Carolina South Dakota Tennessee Texas United States Department of Defense Utah Vermont Virgin Islands Virginia Washington West Virginia Wisconsin Wyoming * School / District Begin typing your full school name to select from a list of matching schools. (Ex: Community Consolidated instead of CCSD.) Select \"Other\" if you do not see your school/district listed. Your eligibility must be verified to purchase WIDA assessments. Provide the requested information in the fields below prior to placing your order. If you plan to only purchase Standards materials or Can Dos Descriptors, you may type “Individual” in the url field. If you believe your school was a member of the former WIDA International School Consortium, which ended June 30th, please go back to the School/District drop down and find your school. * Other * City * URL Access Are you employed by a school district that administers the ACCESS for ELLs® 2.0 tests, or a state employee? Yes Account Details * First name * Last name * Email Address * Phone number(with country code) * Password12 characters minimum * Password confirmation Receive updates from WIDA? WCEPS does not share contact information with anyone but the copyright owners. By checking the box, you agree to allow us to use your email to send you news and updates. Tax exempt form Tax ID Number/VAT Number Tax Exempt Expiration Date Tax Exempt Status Never Expires Shipping details Save time by optionally adding shipping addresses here to save them to your account for use in the future. + Add shipping address",
