    "content": "Search Welcome to the WIDA Store! Ready to Shop? WIDA product eligibility and pricing is based on your district/school location Step 1: Provide the required information about your district/school Let's Go! Step 2: View the products available for purchase at the correct price View Products Learn more about other programs. A school-wide assessment and feedback system that measures key instructional leadership practices that enhance instruction for English learners WIDA SIS The Wisconsin Center for Education (WCEPS) delivers WIDA-developed workshops focused on WIDA Assessment, standards and instructional practice in both English and Spanish. Licensed Workshops A tool to assist publishers and educators in analyzing their materials for the presence of key components of the WIDA ELD Standards. WIDA PRIME Sign up for updates from WCEPS! Don't miss out on updates and new releases",
