    "id": "4ae2b933-4506-497b-bfd0-de41847a7a25",
    "title": "WIDA Store",
    "content": "Search How to Order & FAQ Search FAQs Ordering FAQs Who is eligible to purchase WIDA Assessments? WIDA Screener Paper for grades 1-12 and WIDA MODEL may be purchased by U.S. schools and international schools that teach a full curriculum with English as the language of instruction.WIDA Screener Paper for Kindergarten is available only to U.S. public schools in WIDA Consortium states.WIDA assessments are not available to tutoring organizations, parents of students, or other individuals who are not employed at an eligible school. Can I receive a quote? Option 1: Receive a quote immediately by submitting an online order. Add the items to the shopping cart, select Purchase Order as the payment method, but do not upload any documents. You will receive an email confirmation with the order details. The order will be placed on hold until we receive the purchase order. Send the purchase order to store@wceps.org and include the order number. Option 2: Send an email to store@wceps.org with the items, quantities, billing name and address, and shipping name and address. A quote will be sent by email within 24 hours. Can I place my order online? Yes, all orders should be placed online. See the Placing Your Order section below for instructions on ordering materials. Can I call in my order or mail in my purchase order? No, we require orders to be placed online. Do I need to create an account for the WIDA Store? No, you do not need to create an account. You may continue as a guest. After placing an order, you will receive an email with instructions on creating an account. I have an account for the WIDA Store but I forgot my password. How do I retrieve it? Click the Forgot your password link on the Log In page. I have an account for the WIDA Secure Portal. Do I use the same log in? The WIDA Store is a separate site from the WIDA Secure Portal. We need your vendor information. Do you have a W9? Our W-9 is available here. What payment methods do you accept? You may pay online by Purchase Order or Credit Card. If you are an international school we also accept wire transfers but you must email us to request a pro forma invoice. How do I get a status update on an order I placed? Please email store@wceps.org and include your order number. How do I know my member status? Your member status is determined by the type of school where you are employed and the location of the school.WIDA Members: you are considered a WIDA Member if you are employed by a public school within a WIDA state or territory. You may visit the WIDA site to see the map of WIDA states and territories.Non-Member: you are considered a Non-Member if you are 1) employed by a private school within a WIDA State, 2) employed by any school not in a WIDA state or 3) employed by a school outside of the US. How do I find the items I want to order? Click on \"View Products\" to see all products available. You may filter by product category, or you may use the search bar on the top, right-hand corner to search by name or item number. How do I get the correct member pricing? Your pricing is determined by providing the information about your district/school that is requested in Step 1. Pricing is determined by your country, state and type of district/school where you are employed. If you are an individual purchasing for your own use, please select \"Other\" after entering your state as you will not have a district to select. What information is saved if I create an account? Your account will save your membership status, your tax exempt status, your order history and any shipping addresses you may use when placing orders.You may update your account at any time. Can I fax my order? No, we do not have a fax machine. Please place your order online. Our district is tax exempt. Will we be charged tax? You will be asked your tax exempt status to determine if you will be charged tax. If you are tax exempt, please either upload your tax exempt form when placing your order or email your tax exempt documentation to store@wceps.org. Are you the sole source provider of WIDA Products? Yes, we are the sole source provider of all items in the WIDA Store. Can I return items? Please see our Return Policy for more information. Can my shipment be expedited? If you need expedited shipping please email store@wceps.org with the date you need your order. Where do I send my check for payment? Remit checks to: WCEPS 1213 N. Sherman Ave, #322 Madison, WI 53704 Placing Your Order Placing Order: Step 1 Select one of two buttons when arriving at the WIDA Store – Log In or Shop Now.If you are not logging in to a previously created account, you may Continue as Guest.Continue through the steps continue as a guest. You will receive instructions on creating an account after placing your order. will be prompted to enter your district or school information. This is how the site determines your member status and your product and pricing eligibility.US Customers – select your District name. If you work at a charter school or private school that is not associated with a public school district you will select your individual school name.International Customers – select your school name.If you do not see your district or school name you can select \"Other\" and enter the name manually.Continue through the steps continue as a guest. You will receive instructions on creating an account after placing your order. Placing Order: Search for items to add to your cart Click on \"View Products\" on the top, left-hand corner to see all products available.You may filter by product category, or you may use the search bar on the top, right-hand corner to search by name or item number.Continue through the checkout process. Placing Order: Pay by credit card or purchase order If paying by credit card, the information you enter in the Billing Section must match the name and address associated with your credit card.If paying by purchase order and you have your purchase order:Upload your PO and enter your PO number in the PO Number field.Your order will be processed immediately and an invoice will be emailedIf paying by purchase order and you do not have your purchase order:Submit your orderYou will receive an email with a copy of your order to provide to your business officeOnce you have your PO, email it to store@wceps.org and include your order informationUpon receiving your PO, WCEPS will process your order and an invoice will be emailed Customer Support WCEPS provides full customer support for all products and services. If you have any questions or concerns regarding your purchase, we recommend emailing us at store@wceps.org. This will result in a faster response. You may also call 877-272-5593 but a response may be delayed. Customer support is available Monday through Friday from 8 a.m. – 5 p.m. Central Standard Time.",
