    "content": "Independence Day reading July 3, 2020 | M. Bruce King We are committed to ensuring that the full history and context of Independence Day be addressed authentically by teachers and students. Subsequently, we offer the following reading to all AIW educators: \"What to the Slave is the Fourth of July?\" by Frederick Douglass (July 5, 1852). Author M. Bruce King Director, AIW Institute",
