    "content": "Use the files in this project, along with the information found on wcepspathways.org, to provide answers to the questions below. These questions would be questions from K-12 educators. Please also provide feedback on where we are lacking in information or resources that can answer some of these questions. Can you explain the concept of dialogic communication? what is Dialogic Communication and Teaching What is the meaning of dialogic in communication and education? What are some examples of dialogic practices in education How can dialogic teaching improve classroom interactions? What is the meaning of dialogic in communication and education? How can dialogic teaching improve classroom interactions? How do teachers encourage students to speak math confidently? Are there any resources for learning how to talk about math better? How can I improve my ability to speak mathematics clearly? What are some effective ways to teach math through conversation? Are there any resources for learning h...",
