    "id": "9bbb1bb0-129c-40c0-a7b5-50bf4e3cd639",
    "title": "12.5.2025 Emlyn Frangiosa",
    "content": "Title: 12.5.2025 Emlyn Frangiosa\n\nContent: Dec 5, 2024 | (<https://www.google.com/calendar/event?eid=MHZ0MzRuNWVxMGxzM29yNXJhbjk3aTI1bDggbWFyZ2FyaXRhLm1hcnJlcm9Ad2NlcHMub3Jn>)**Discuss PD w/ Emlyn  Attendees: (<mailto:yvonne.williams@wceps.org>)Yvonne Williams (<mailto:margarita.marrero@wceps.org>)Margarita Marrero (<mailto:efrangiosa@avongrove.org>)efrangiosa@avongrove.org  Notes  ●  Still looking for support for DL immersion  ●  Seal of Biliteracy support  ●  WIDA SIS  ●  Has not seen invoices (from Jessica)  ○  Administrative support - 1 new administrator is not ready yet for this kind of support  ○  Vision for the summer  ■  Historically do WIDA SIS, a day-long workshop with k-12 teachers to create action plans, (have also used CALL)  ■  Moving forward, administrators would like to run their own (site-based) workshops; could reallocate to support administrators in what they should be looking for. Could do a workshop before the school year begins or earlier in the summer to build capacity with administrators to support action planning  ■  Hope to have 3rd, 4th, and 5th grade teachers identified for DLI and full onboarding K-5 to have everyone on the same page with the vision  ●  Has met twice with (<mailto:nora.delgado@wcepspl.org>)Nora Delgado for DLI support  ○  Friday, Oct 11, 2024 - 1 hour  ○  Wednesday, Oct 30, 2024 - 1 hour  ●  Sy 24-25 Quote  ○  Coaching with Dr. Costa (pending 3 hours $3250) - can be reallocated to half-day workshop with administrators  ○  Virtual coaching for DLI with Nora ($4500 left)  ○  SEAL of Biliteracy (Mishelle) - could possibly get support from (<mailto:nora.delgado@wcepspl.org>)Nora Delgado  ■  Wants to make sure the vision is upheld and the seal benefits ELs  ○  WIDA SIS - already used funds and implemented  Action items  Nora D to send follow-up email to summarize and let us know when they met  With funds left for this year - a workshop with building administrators on increasing rigor  Students to have more meaningful conversations  One particular school focusing more on writing  For teachers, PLC time 30 minutes (2-5 building) 25-26 SY could do workshops during this time (in person or virtual )  4-5 extended discourse is more missing (participation is limited to small group with the teacher and independent work) - possibly the Discussion Project  2-3 possibly writing topic  Use the $3250 to apply for admin half day, either in 3 hours or two 1.5 hours to be done virtually in the Spring of 2025.  Create a quote for the targeted customized PLC sessions for $6000 11:30-2:00pm, 11:30, 12:10 12:50, 1:30 for virtual sessions, meet twice 2-3 writing 4-5 extended discourse, get them speaking. October and January as an example  Dual Language 3 virtual check-ins to continue the conversation $1000  Total quote $10,250 - $3250 that will be done this year ",
