    "title": "**Racine Planning Call",
    "content": "Title: **Racine Planning Call\n\nContent: **Racine Planning Call  | carFeb 27, 2025  Attendees: (<mailto:margarita.marrero@wceps.org>)Margarita Marrero (<mailto:mishelle.jurado@wcepspl.org>)Mishelle Jurado (<mailto:priscilla.marquez@rusd.org>)Priscilla Marquez  Notes  ●  Action items  WCEPS Professional Development Planning Document  Summary of  PD Plan  District: Racine  Date of Call: February 27, 2025  Workshop Title & Description:  Date(s) of Event(s)/Time  March 11, 2024  Time: (include time zone): See notes below  Location(s) of Event(s) or confirmation of zoom registration received  Mitchell School  2701 Drexel Ave  Racine WI 53403  PD Facilitator Contact Information  Mishelle Jurado  LEA Contact(s) cell number  Priscilla 262-237-0478 and Heather (262-939-5581)  Participants  Anticipated Numbers  Position(s) of Participants:  Coaches and teachers  8-10am Coaches in the morning - (Coaching Stems Use)  Focusing on resources and look fors grounded in -Bridging, Asi se Dice and Dictado  Have them use a chart paper to make suggestions and what kind of language they would use to co-construct with the teachers what are the language demands.  10:30-12pm K-2: more in depth for Translanguaging  1:30-3:00 - 3rd to 8th grade: translanguaging (lots of teachers 4-8 have DL co-teaching model for English/Spanish)  Create the one pager of strategies  This year - starting language portfolios currently ESL teachers responsibilities  Include a “planting the seed” activity for language portfolios considering multiliteracy and translanguaging  Question - scoring rubric for portfolios in different languages  Notes - **Racine Meeting w/Mishelle  Goal & How will it be measured?  Look for’s resource for classroom observations Google Folder resources one-pager Surveys  Exit slip for portfolio activities  Any additional  notes/questions  Notes and ideas for next year - focus on assessment through portfolios in multiple languages and also for goal of Seal of Biliteracy  Resource for Seal of Biliteracy  Chapter 15b Language Artifact Portfolio MIP.pdf  Materials needed/Padlet link:  Markers and chart paper  AM Session (start / end time)  Lunch (minimum of 1 hour)  PM Session (start / end time) ",
