    "content": "Title: C.A.R.E. Coaching\n\nContent: C.A.R.E. Coaching  Building Capacity to Bridge Content Learning and Language Development  Note-Taker  Big Ideas  Equity of Access and Opportunity  Collaboration among Stakeholders  Integration of Language and Content  Functional Approach to Language  Components of the Framework  WIDA English Language Development Standards Statements & Abbreviations  Key Language Uses Narrate Inform Explain Argue  Modes of Communication  Reference Codes  Anatomy of a Language Expectation  Stem  Function  Feature  Interpretive  Expressive  Language Functions & Language Features  Proficiency Level Descriptors  Additional Notes ",
