  {
    "id": "2e06942e-ae60-4bb2-a872-ed409fb2b41e",
    "title": "People Terry Hofer",
    "content": "Description: Callsurveyv2\n\nTerry Hofer WestEd Team Director of School Improvement, WestEd About Terry Hofer is a Director of School Improvement at WestEd and helps lead WestEd’s Center for School Turnaround and Improvement. He has worked with educators at all levels to support school improvement in more than 27 states. In various roles at WestEd, Terry has provided leadership coaching and school transformation support to numerous SIG and CSI schools using aspects of WestEd’s Four Domains of Rapid School Improvement Framework. Evidence of impact has been noted with schools exiting priority school status, meeting demonstrable indicators, and increasing leading indicators tracked using the Four Domains Comprehensive Assessment of Leadership for Learning (CALL).",
    "document_type": "website",
