  {
    "id": "38ad895b-2517-416e-9d2a-83efa36551a7",
    "title": "People Yvonne Williams",
    "content": "Description: Callsurveyv2\n\nYvonne Williams CARE Coaching Team Director of MLL Educator Engagement at WCEPS, CARE Bilingual Coach: English/Spanish About Yvonne, a dynamic leader and presenter, currently serves as the Director of Multilingual Learner Educator Engagement at WCEPS, where she plays a pivotal role in fostering collaboration with Local Education Agencies (LEAs). In this capacity, she engages intimately with educators, delving into their goals and needs to chart a course that aligns seamlessly with their objectives. Yvonne's journey is marked by resilience and the pursuit of excellence, having immigrated from Chihuahua, Mexico, to the United States at the age of 5. This immigrant experience enriches her professional endeavors with a unique perspective as an English language learner, infusing passion into her work.",
