    "title": "People Matt Messinger",
    "content": "Description: Callsurveyv2\n\nMatt Messinger CALL Team WCEPS Executive Director About Matt Messinger is the Executive Director for the Wisconsin Center for Education Products and Services (WCEPS). WCEPS is non-profit organization that distributes and manages CALL. WCEPS works with UW-Madison innovators to commercialize and disseminate educational products and services. Prior to WCEPS, Matt spent seven years working at for-profit educational technology firms, including four years at Renaissance Learning, Inc. Earlier in his career, Matt worked for three years as a college counselor at Eastside College Prep, a school for low-income students. Matt earned his BA from Stanford University.",
