    "content": "Description: The online reporting system for the WIDA School Improvement System (WIDA SIS) provides action-based data for supporting instruction of English Learners.\n\nBack to Articles Categories: All updates news USBE WestEd School Improvement Personalized Learning Long Distance CALL Virtual Online Remote Short Demo of the WIDA SIS Online Reporting System Share The WIDA School Improvement System (WIDA SIS) assesses key school-wide leadership practices that enhance teaching and learning for English Learners. This short demo presents the action-based data that school leaders use to support school improvement planning and professional development planning. For more information and for your own personal demo, please contact us.",
