  {
    "id": "f9f7e9e4-8bd8-4b2e-ab5b-d93d07ad7c24",
    "title": "Video: What is the WIDA School Improvement System (WIDA SIS)?",
    "content": "Description: This short video introduces the WIDA School Improvement System (WIDA SIS).\n\nBack to Articles Categories: All updates news USBE WestEd School Improvement Personalized Learning Long Distance CALL Virtual Online Remote Video: What is the WIDA School Improvement System (WIDA SIS)? Share To support the growing, diverse English Learner (EL) student population, school and district leaders need tools and resources that provide targeted data to help enhance teaching and learning for ALL students. This video provides a short introduction to the WIDA School Improvement System (WIDA SIS), which is designed to support school improvement and professional development planning by focusing on leadership for teaching ELs. Please contact us for a one-to-one online demonstration.",
