    "content": "Description: Educators in School District 49 (CO) talk about their experience with WIDA SIS and the CARE Coaching Process.\n\nBack to Articles Categories: All updates news USBE WestEd School Improvement Personalized Learning Long Distance CALL Virtual Online Remote WIDA SIS and CARE Coaching: What Educators are Saying Share Educators from School District 49 in Colorado implemented the WIDA School Improvement System (WIDA SIS) and engaged in the CARE Coaching process to support their use of the WIDA SIS data to improve instruction for English Language Learners. Hear from some educators on participating in this process. WIDA SIS and CARE Coaching are part of the Pathways for Language Learner Success Process.",
