    "content": "Description: Tracy Vandeventer from the Utah State Board of Education and Terry Hofer from WestEd discuss the rollout of the Four Domains for Rapid School Improvement and Four Domains CALL in Utah.\n\nBack to Articles Categories: All updates news USBE WestEd School Improvement Personalized Learning Long Distance CALL Virtual Online Remote USBE and WestEd Leaders on Four Domains CALL Share The CALL Team has been working with Tracy Vandeventer from the Utah State Board of Education and Terry Hofer from WestEd on implementing Four Domains CALL in schools and LEAs across the state. At the 2022 National ESEA Conference, they discussed the rollout of the Four Domains for Rapid School Improvement and Four Domains CALL in Utah.Here's what school and LEA leaders are saying as well.Please contact CALL for more information.",
