    "id": "aa222905-b679-46fc-9f89-aef082f85171",
    "title": "Four Domains CALL at WestEd: What Leaders are Saying",
    "content": "Description: School leaders share their experiences in using Four Domains CALL.\n\nBack to Articles Categories: All updates news USBE WestEd School Improvement Personalized Learning Long Distance CALL Virtual Online Remote Four Domains CALL at WestEd: What Leaders are Saying Categories: School Improvement Usbe West Ed Share School Leaders are using the Comprehensive Assessment of Leadership for Learning (CALL), aligned to the Four Domains for Rapid School Improvement at WestEd. In this video, leaders describe the process for using Four Domains CALL, the benefits they see in using the system, and offer advice to other school leaders regarding Four Domains CALL. If you are a school or district leader and are interested in implementing Four Domains CALL, please contact WestEd. Check our more information on Four Domains CALL.",
